Third-party library notices for the archived web application

The original web pages in old/ load the following JavaScript libraries from
their respective CDNs at runtime. Their minified distributions are not included
in this repository. The native Rust/egui application does not link or bundle
D3.js; it implements its graph rendering in Rust. `old/graphtool.js` is the
CrinGraph application code that calls the D3 APIs, not a copy of D3 itself.

