Fuse.js 3.4.4
(loaded from https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/fuse.js/3.4.4/fuse.min.js)
License: Apache License 2.0
Its license text is available at https://unpkg.com/fuse.js@3.4.4/LICENSE.

Fuse.js is used by the archived web pages in old/ and is loaded from a
CDN. The native application has a separate Rust fuzzy-search implementation intended
to provide similar search behavior.
